      "text": "Include blocked unloading in transfer-clerk burden. Inspection requires thirteen minutes from a separate clerk, so uninterrupted eligibility is necessary for completion by 13. Active inspection occupies a rack place. Extra staff, rack places and recharge are unavailable."
    },
