      ],
      "text": "Choose the present feasible boundary-ledger dry run before selecting an account: inspect continuously whenever eligible; trolley B4-B7 starts at 0, trolley B8-B11 at 3 after unloading, hand B12 at 6 after unloading. Closest rival: consecutive one-minute hand trips B4-B12 from 0, same inspection rules. Enforce arrival order, whole-load waiting and inspection completion before unloading. Record identities, occupancy, charge, correct releases and both clerks occupied intervals."
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-s-opposing-accounts",
      "source_refs": [
