        "C5",
        "C6",
        "O4",
        "M1",
        "M2",
        "M3",
        "M4",
        "U3"
      ],
      "text": "Retain incompatible hypotheses until the trace is checked. A: full trolley batches preserve continuity and reduce labor; prediction: nine unloads by 7, twelve correct releases by 13, seven occupied transfer minutes versus nine for a successful hand rival. B: whole-load blocking erases that advantage; prediction: the same batch sequence misses twelve releases by 13 or occupies at least nine transfer minutes, letting hand carrying win or tie."
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-s-defeat",
