      "text": "Defeat A if its sequence misses the release goal or fails to beat the successful rival on occupied transfer minutes. Defeat B if the checked trace gives nine unloads by 7, twelve correct releases by 13 and seven occupied transfer minutes against the successful rival's nine. Predictions are not received trial results."
